Doxygen Awesome CSS
===================

Upstream: https://github.com/jothepro/doxygen-awesome-css
Version: v2.4.2
License: MIT (see LICENSE)

This directory contains the unmodified base stylesheet and the four JavaScript
extensions used by the libfreenect2 documentation: dark-mode toggle, fragment
copy button, paragraph links, and interactive table of contents. Sidebar-only
styles and the experimental tabs extension are intentionally not vendored.
